OL,3,GNEWSAMigration Museum given less space
OL,4,Aat new site
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon's Migration Museum will be given
OL,7,Fa third less space than originally
OL,8,Fagreed in a new 21-storey block, to
OL,9,Fallow for more student accommodation.
OL,11,FThe museum, which explores how movement
OL,12,Fto and from the UK shapes the nation,
OL,13,Fwas offered a permanent rent-free home
OL,14,Ffor 60 years at 65 Crutched Friars in
OL,15,Fthe City of London under a scheme by
OL,16,Fdeveloper Dominus.
OL,18,FIn plans approved in 2023, the museum
OL,19,Fwas given three floors. But on
OL,20,FWednesday, City of London Corporation
OL,21,Fmembers signed off on revised plans for
OL,22,Ftwo floors for the museum.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
