OL,3,GNEWSAMigration Museum given less space
OL,4,Aat new site
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaurie Boult, chief executive of the
OL,7,Fmuseum, said the decision gave them
OL,8,F"certainty" that it could proceed with
OL,9,Fthe project.
